  "notes": "POI: Blackpool Tower (158 m; Historic England 53.8159,-3.0552). Owner's point treated as take-off (seafront, ~100 m W of the tower). WP1 starts 80 m behind take-off over the beach, then a steady ~40 deg climb straight at the tower to 115 m (DJI Fly height) and a 60 m-radius orbit with the camera tilted up at the upper tower. 115 m leaves ~5 m margin under the 120 m limit (measured from the closest ground, which here is level with the promenade). Tower is ~5.2 km (2.8 nm) from Blackpool Airport's reference point; its FRZ covers the seafront south of Central Pier."
